      "content": "It's clear that the damage feels permanent, and the weight of what others have seen is crushing. But even if the past is stained, the present moment is still yours to decide. You don't have to carry the weight of every judgment they've cast; you can choose to let that noise fade into the background. There are ways to start rebuilding, even when everything feels irrevocably lost.",
      "source": "target",
